hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1066","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhe apne baapon ki qasam khane se manع farmata hai. Umar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne jab se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye kehte suna, na zikr karte hue qasam khayi na naql karte hue."
"1067","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin al-Khattab ko qafile mein paya jabke Wo apne walid ki qasam kha rahe they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe pukara: Suno! Beshak Allah tumhe apne baapon ki qasam khane se manع farmata hai. Phir jo qasam khane wala ho wo Allah ki qasam khaye, warna khamosh rahe."
"1068","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur apni qasam mein Lat aur Uzza kahe to use chahiye ke kahe: La ilaha illallah. Aur jo apne sathi se kahe: Aao main tum se jua khelun, to use chahiye ke sadqa kare."
"1069","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere sathiyon ne mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas bheja taake Aap se un ke liye sawariyan mangun, jab wo Aap ke sath tangi wale lashkar mein they, jo Tabuk ki ladayi hai. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Nabiullah! Beshak mere sathiyon ne mujhe tumhare paas bheja hai taake tum unhe sawari do. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main tumhe kisi cheez par sawar nahi karunga. Aur main Aap ko ghazab-naak paya, mujhe ilm na tha. Aur main Aap ke manع karne se aur is dar se ghamgeen lauta ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh par dil mein bura mana ho. Phir main apne sathiyon ke paas lauta aur unhe wo khabar di jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha. Phir main thodi der ke siwa na thehra ke main ne Bilal ko pukarte suna: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Phir main ne unhe jawab diya. To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe bulate hain, jawab do. Phir jab main Aap ke paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ye do jode aur ye do jode lo, chhe oonton ke liye jo Aap ne us waqt Sa'd se khareede they. Phir unhe apne sathiyon ke paas le jao. Phir kaho ke Allah, ya farmaya: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe in par sawar karte hain, to un par sawar ho jao. Phir main unhe lekar un ke paas gaya. Phir main ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe in par sawar karte hain. Lekin main, Allah ki qasam! Tumhe nahi chhorunga yahan tak ke tum mein se kuchh mere sath us ke paas chale jis ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul suna. Tum ye gumaan na karo ke main ne tumhe koi baat bayan ki jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nahi farmayi. Phir unhon ne mujh se kaha: Beshak tum hamare nazdeek sache ho. Aur hum zaroor karenge jo tum pasand karo. Phir Abu Musa un mein se ek jamaat ke sath chale yahan tak ke un ke paas aaye jinhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka unhe manع karne ka qaul suna tha, phir is ke baad unhe dena. Phir unhon ne unhe waisa hi bayan kiya jaisa Abu Musa ne unhe bayan kiya tha."
"1070","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa se Zahdam ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Abu Musa ke paas they. Phir murghi ka zikr aaya, jabke un ke paas Bani Taimullah mein se ek mard tha, surkh, goya mawaliyon mein se. Phir unhon ne use khane ke liye bulaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne use koi cheez khate dekha to mujhe nafrat hui. Phir main ne qasam khayi ke nahi khaunga. To unhon ne kaha: Aao, main tumhe is ke bare mein bayan karunga. Beshak main Ash'ariyon mein se ek jamaat mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya taake Aap hamein sawari dein. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main tumhe sawar nahi karunga. Aur mere paas jo tumhe sawar karun nahi hai. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas loote hue oont laye gaye. Phir Aap ne hamare bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ash'ari jamaat kahan hai? Phir Aap ne hamare liye paanch khubsurat kohan wale oont ka hukm farmaya. Phir jab hum chale to hum ne kaha: Hum ne kya kiya? Hamein barkat nahi di jayegi. Phir hum Aap ki taraf laute. Phir hum ne kaha: Hum ne tum se sawal kiya ke hamein sawari do. Phir tum ne qasam khayi ke tum hamein sawar nahi karoge. To kya tum bhool gaye? Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhe sawar nahi kiya, lekin Allah ne tumhe sawar kiya. Aur beshak main, Allah ki qasam! Agar Allah ne chaha, kisi qasam par qasam nahi khaunga aur us ke siwa ko us se behtar dekhunga magar usے karunga jo behtar hai, aur use kholunga."
"1071","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abd al-Rahman bin Samura! Imarat na mango. Kyunke agar tumhe wo mangne se di gayi to tum us ke hawale kiye jaoge. Aur agar tumhe wo baghair mange di gayi to tumhari madad ki jayegi. Aur jab tum qasam khao aur us ke siwa ko us se behtar dekho to apni qasam ka kaffara do aur wo karo jo behtar hai."
"1072","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Dawud (alaihimasalam) ne kaha: Main aaj raat sau aurton ke paas ghoomunga. Har aurat ladka janegi jo Allah ke raste mein ladega. To farishte ne un se kaha: Kaho agar Allah ne chaha. Phir unhon ne na kaha aur bhool gaye. Phir wo un ke paas ghoome. Aur un mein se ek ke siwa kisi ne na jana, aadha insan. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar kehte ke agar Allah ne chaha to qasam na todte, aur apni hajat ke liye zyada ummeed rakhte."
"1073","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sulaiman bin Dawud ne kaha: Main aaj raat sattar aurton ke paas ghoomunga. Har aurat hamla hogi sawari se jo Allah ke raste mein jihad karega. Phir un ke sathi ne un se kaha: Agar Allah ne chaha. Phir unhon ne na kaha. Aur koi hamla na hui siwaye ek ke, gira hua us ka ek pehlu. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar kehte to Allah ke raste mein jihad karte."
"1074","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se ek ka apni qasam par apne ghar walon mein israr karna us ke liye Allah ke nazdeek us se zyada gunah hai ke wo us ka kaffara de jo Allah ne us par farz kiya hai."
"1075","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mujh par jahiliyat mein ek din ka i'tikaf tha. To Aap ne unhe hukm diya ke use poora karein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Umar ne Hunain ke qaidiyon mein se do londiyan payein. Phir unhe Makkah ke kuchh gharon mein rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hunain ke qaidiyon par ehsan farmaya. Phir wo galiyon mein daudne lage. Phir Umar ne kaha: Ae Abdullah! Dekho ye kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qaidiyon par ehsan farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Jao aur dono londiyon ko bhejo."
"1076","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apne ghulam par tohmat lagaye jabke wo us se bari hai jo us ne kaha, Qayamat ke din kode mare jayenge, magar ye ke wo ho jaisa us ne kaha."
"1077","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr se Ma'rur ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dharr se Rabdha mein mulaqat ki, jabke Aap par joda tha aur Aap ke ghulam par joda tha. Phir main ne un se is ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne ek shakhs ko gali di aur use us ki maan se aar dilaya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr! Kya tum ne use us ki maan se aar dilaya? Beshak tum aise shakhs ho jis mein jahiliyat hai. Tumhare bhai tumhare khadim hain, Allah ne unhe tumhare hathon ke neeche kiya hai. Phir jis ka bhai us ke hath ke neeche ho use chahiye ke use khilaye jo wo khata hai, pehnaye jo wo pehenta hai. Aur unhe takleef na do jo un par ghalib aaye. Phir agar tum unhe takleef do to un ki madad karo."
"1078","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas us ka khadim us ka khana laye, phir agar wo use apne sath na bithaye to use chahiye ke use ek ya do luqme, ya ek ya do niwale de. Kyunke us ne us ki garmi aur ilaj ko jhela hai."
"1079","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghulam jab apne aaqa ki khair-khwahi kare aur apne Rab ki ibadat achhi kare to us ke liye do martaba us ka ajr tha."
"1080","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nek mamluk ghulam ke liye do ajr hain. Aur Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar Allah ke raste mein jihad, hajj aur meri walida se neki na hoti to main pasand karta ke marun jabke main ghulam hun."
"1081","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Un mein se ek ke liye kya hi achha hai ke wo apne Rab ki ibadat achhi kare aur apne aaqa ki khair-khwahi kare."
"1082","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam mein apna hissa aazad kare, phir us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunche, to ghulam ki insaf se qeemat lagayi jayegi. Phir wo apne shareekon ko un ke hisse dega aur us par aazad ho jayega. Warna us mein se jo aazad hua aazad hua."
"1083","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam mein se tukda aazad kare to us par usے apne maal mein aazad karana lazim hai. Phir agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam ki insaf se qeemat lagayi jayegi. Phir us se kamayi karayi jayegi baghair us par sakhti kiye."
"1084","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne apne ghulam ko tadbeer par aazad kiya, jabke us ke paas us ke siwa maal na tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaun use mujh se khareedta hai? Phir use Nu'aim bin al-Nahham ne aath sau dirham mein khareeda."
